"This action will delete all unsaved orders and other locally stored data"
msgstr "ການກະທຳນີ້ຈະລຶບອໍເດີທັງໝົດທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນບັນທຶກ ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນອື່ນໆ ທີ່ບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນເຄື່ອງນີ້"

#. module: point_of_sale
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/point_of_sale/static/src/app/services/barcode_reader_service.js:0
msgid ""
"This barcode is not compatible with the GS1 standard. Consider configuring a "
"fallback barcode parser from the PoS settings."
msgstr ""
"ບາໂຄດນີ້ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບມາດຕະຖານ GS1. ກະລຸນາພິຈາລະນາຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວແປງບາໂຄດສຳຮອງຈາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ PoS."

#. module: point_of_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/point_of_sale/models/pos_config.py:0
msgid ""
"This cash payment method is already used in another Point of Sale.\n"
"A new cash payment method should be created for this Point of Sale."
msgstr ""
"ວິທີການຊຳລະດ້ວຍເງິນສົດນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນຈຸດຂາຍໜ້າຮ້ານອື່ນແລ້ວ.\n"
"ຄວນສ້າງວິທີການຊຳລະດ້ວຍເງິນສົດຂຶ້ນໃໝ່ສຳລັບຈຸດຂາຍໜ້າຮ້ານນີ້."

