msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດຈັດເກັບປຶ້ມບັນທຶກປະຈຳວັນນີ້ໄດ້ ເນື່ອງຈາກມັນຖືກຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃນວິທີການຊຳລະເງິນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້: %s."

#. module: point_of_sale
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/point_of_sale/static/src/app/screens/product_screen/product_screen.js:0
msgid "You can not change the %s of the refund order."
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດປ່ຽນ %s ຂອງອໍເດີສົ່ງເງິນຄືນໄດ້."

#. module: point_of_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/point_of_sale/models/pos_session.py:0
msgid ""
"You can only cancel a session that is in opening control state and has no "
"orders."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດຍົກເລີກໄດ້ສະເພາະຮອບການຂາຍທີ່ຢູ່ໃນສະຖານະຄວບຄຸມການເປີດ ແລະ ບໍ່ມີອໍເດີເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. module: point_of_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/point_of_sale/models/pos_order.py:0
msgid "You can only refund products from the same order."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດສົ່ງເງິນຄືນໄດ້ສະເພາະສິນຄ້າທີ່ມາຈາກອໍເດີດຽວກັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. module: point_of_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/point_of_sale/models/pos_order_line.py:0
msgid ""
"You can only unlink PoS order lines that are related to orders in new or "
"cancelled state."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດຍົກເລີກການເຊື່ອມໂຍງລາຍການອໍເດີ PoS ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບອໍເດີໃນສະຖານະໃໝ່ ຫຼື ຖືກຍົກເລີກເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. module: point_of_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/point_of_sale/models/account_move.py:0
msgid ""
"You can't reset this invoice to draft because the POS session is still open. "
"Please close the ongoing session first, then try again."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໃບແຈ້ງໜີ້ນີ້ກັບເປັນສະຖານະຮ່າງໄດ້ ເນື່ອງຈາກຮອບການຂາຍ PoS ຍັງເປີດຢູ່. "
"ກະລຸນາປິດຮອບການຂາຍປະຈຸບັນກ່ອນ, ແລ້ວລອງໃໝ່ອີກຄັ້ງ."

#. module: point_of_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/point_of_sale/models/pos_order.py:0
msgid ""
"You can't: create a pos order from the backend interface, or unset the "
"pricelist, or create a pos.order in a python test with Form tool, or edit "
"the form view in studio if no PoS order exist"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດ: ສ້າງອໍເດີ PoS ຈາກລະບົບຫຼັງບ້ານ, ຫຼື ຍົກເລີກການເລືອກລາຍການລາຄາ, ຫຼື ສ້າງ "
"pos.order ໃນການທົດສອບ python ດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງມືແບບຟອມ, ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂມຸມມອງແບບຟອມໃນ studio ໄດ້ "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ມີອໍເດີ PoS ຢູ່"

#. module: point_of_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/point_of_sale/models/pos_category.py:0
msgid ""
"You cannot archive/delete PoS Product Categories that are used in an active "
"Point of Sale session.\n"
"Close all related PoS sessions first and try again."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດຈັດເກັບ/ລຶບ ໝວດໝູ່ສິນຄ້າ PoS ທີ່ກຳລັງຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນຮອບການຂາຍລະບົບຂາຍໜ້າຮ້ານທີ່ຍັງເປີດຢູ່.\n"
"ກະລຸນາປິດຮອບການຂາຍ PoS ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງທັງໝົດກ່ອນ ແລ້ວລອງໃໝ່ອີກຄັ້ງ."

#. module: point_of_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/point_of_sale/models/pos_category.py:0
msgid ""
"You cannot archive/delete a category which is currently in use in a point of "
"sale."
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດຈັດເກັບ/ລຶບ ໝວດໝູ່ທີ່ກຳລັງຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນຈຸດຂາຍໜ້າຮ້ານໄດ້."

#. module: point_of_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/point_of_sale/models/product_template.py:0
msgid ""
"You cannot archive/delete a product that is set as a special product in a "
"Point of Sale configuration. Please change the configuration first."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດຈັດເກັບ/ລຶບ ສິນຄ້າທີ່ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນສິນຄ້າພິເສດໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າລະບົບຂາຍໜ້າຮ້ານໄດ້. "
"ກະລຸນາປ່ຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າກ່ອນ."

#. module: point_of_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/point_of_sale/models/product_template.py:0
msgid ""
"You cannot archive/delete product(s) that are available in an active Point "
"of Sale session.\n"
"\n"
"Archiving/Deleting a product available in a session would be like attempting "
"to snatch a hamburger from a customer’s hand mid-bite; chaos will ensue as "
"ketchup and mayo go flying everywhere!"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດຈັດເກັບ/ລຶບ ສິນຄ້າທີ່ມີພ້ອມຂາຍໃນຮອບການຂາຍລະບົບຂາຍໜ້າຮ້ານທີ່ກຳລັງເປີດຢູ່ໄດ້.\n"
"\n"
"ການຈັດເກັບ/ລຶບ ສິນຄ້າໃນຂະນະທີ່ກຳລັງເປີດຮອບຂາຍ "
"ປຽບເໝືອນການພະຍາຍາມຍາດເອົາແຮມເບີເກີຈາກມືລູກຄ້າຕອນກຳລັງກັດກິນ; "
"ຄວາມວຸ້ນວາຍຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນຍ້ອນຊັອສໝາກເລັ່ນ ແລະ ມາຍອງເນສກະຈາຍໄປທົ່ວ!"

#. module: point_of_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/point_of_sale/models/pos_order.py:0
msgid "You cannot change the payment of a printed order."
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງການຊຳລະເງິນຂອງອໍເດີທີ່ພິມແລ້ວ."

#. module: point_of_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/point_of_sale/models/pos_session.py:0
msgid ""
"You cannot close the POS when invoices are not posted.\n"
"Invoices: %(invoices)s"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດປິດ PoS ໄດ້ເມື່ອໃບແຈ້ງໜີ້ຍັງບໍ່ທັນຖືກລົງບັນຊີ.\n"
"ໃບແຈ້ງໜີ້: %(invoices)s"

#. module: point_of_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/point_of_sale/models/pos_session.py:0
msgid ""
"You cannot close the POS while there are still draft orders for the day."
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດປິດ PoS ໄດ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຍັງມີອໍເດີສະຖານະຮ່າງສຳລັບມື້ນີ້."

#. module: point_of_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/point_of_sale/models/pos_session.py:0
msgid "You cannot create a session starting before: %(lock_date_info)s"
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດສ້າງຮອບການຂາຍທີ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນກ່ອນ: %(lock_date_info)s"

#. module: point_of_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/point_of_sale/models/pos_order.py:0
msgid "You cannot create an invoice for orders with different currencies."
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດອອກໃບແຈ້ງໜີ້ສຳລັບອໍເດີທີ່ມີສະກຸນເງິນຕ່າງກັນໄດ້."

#. module: point_of_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/point_of_sale/models/pos_session.py:0
msgid "You cannot delete a cash move that is not linked to this session."
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດລຶບການເຄື່ອນໄຫວເງິນສົດທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບຮອບການຂາຍນີ້ໄດ້."

#. module: point_of_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/point_of_sale/models/res_partner.py:0
msgid ""
"You cannot delete a customer that has point of sales orders. You can archive "
"it instead."
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດລຶບລູກຄ້າທີ່ມີອໍເດີໃນລະບົບຂາຍໜ້າຮ້ານໄດ້. ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກຈັດເກັບແທນໄດ້."

#. module: point_of_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/point_of_sale/models/pos_preset.py:0
msgid "You cannot delete a preset that is linked to a POS configuration."
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດລຶບຄ່າທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ PoS ໄດ້."

#. module: point_of_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/point_of_sale/models/account_cash_rounding.py:0
msgid ""
"You cannot delete a rounding method that is used in a Point of Sale "
"configuration."
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດລຶບວິທີການປັດເສດທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າລະບົບຂາຍໜ້າຮ້ານໄດ້."

#. module: point_of_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/point_of_sale/models/ir_sequence.py:0
msgid "You cannot delete a sequence used in an active POS config: %s"
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດລຶບລຳດັບທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ PoS ທີ່ກຳລັງເປີດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້: %s"

#. module: point_of_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/point_of_sale/models/pos_payment.py:0
msgid "You cannot edit a payment for a posted order."
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດດັດແກ້ການຊຳລະເງິນສຳລັບອໍເດີທີ່ລົງບັນຊີແລ້ວໄດ້."

#. module: point_of_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/point_of_sale/models/pos_config.py:0
msgid ""
"You cannot have more than one cash payment method on a point of sale "
"configuration."
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດມີວິທີການຊຳລະດ້ວຍເງິນສົດຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງວິທີໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າລະບົບຂາຍໜ້າຮ້ານ."

#. module: point_of_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/point_of_sale/models/pos_order_line.py:0
msgid "You cannot refund more than the outstanding quantity for this product."
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດສົ່ງເງິນຄືນຫຼາຍກວ່າຈຳນວນທີ່ຍັງເຫຼືອຄ້າງສຳລັບສິນຄ້ານີ້."

#. module: point_of_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/point_of_sale/models/pos_config.py:0
msgid "You cannot remove %(pms)s from %(config)s while it has an open session."
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດລຶບ %(pms)s ອອກຈາກ %(config)s ໃນຂະນະທີ່ມີຮອບການຂາຍເປີດຢູ່."

#. module: point_of_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/point_of_sale/models/pos_payment_method.py:0
msgid ""
"You cannot remove '%(pm)s' from %(configs)s while it has an open session."
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດລຶບ '%(pm)s' ອອກຈາກ %(configs)s ໃນຂະນະທີ່ມີຮອບການຂາຍເປີດຢູ່."

#. module: point_of_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/point_of_sale/models/pos_config.py:0
msgid ""
"You cannot share open orders with configuration that does not use the same "
"currency."
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດແບ່ງປັນອໍເດີທີ່ເປີດຢູ່ກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ສະກຸນເງິນດຽວກັນໄດ້."

#. module: point_of_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/point_of_sale/models/pos_config.py:0
msgid "You cannot use the same journal on multiples cash payment methods."
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ປຶ້ມບັນທຶກປະຈຳວັນດຽວກັນກັບຫຼາຍວິທີການຊຳລະດ້ວຍເງິນສົດໄດ້."

#. module: point_of_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/point_of_sale/models/pos_config.py:0
msgid ""
"You do not have permission to open a POS session. Please try opening a "
"session with a different user"
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ມີສິດໃນການເປີດຮອບການຂາຍ PoS. ກະລຸນາລອງເປີດຮອບການຂາຍດ້ວຍຜູ້ໃຊ້ອື່ນ"

#. module: point_of_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/point_of_sale/models/pos_session.py:0
msgid "You don't have the access rights to delete a cash in/out."
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ມີສິດເຂົ້າເຖິງໃນການລຶບລາຍການເອົາເງິນສົດເຂົ້າ/ອອກ."

#. module: point_of_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/point_of_sale/models/pos_session.py:0
msgid "You don't have the access rights to get the cash in/out list."
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ມີສິດເຂົ້າເຖິງໃນການດຶງລາຍການເອົາເງິນສົດເຂົ້າ/ອອກ."

#. module: point_of_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/point_of_sale/models/pos_session.py:0
msgid ""
"You don't have the access rights to get the point of sale closing control "
"data."
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ມີສິດເຂົ້າເຖິງໃນການດຶງຂໍ້ມູນການຄວບຄຸມຕອນປິດລະບົບຂາຍໜ້າຮ້ານ."

#. module: point_of_sale
#. odoo-python
